# Template for ~/.config/scan-secrets/denylist  (copy it there, fill it in, chmod 600).
# NEVER commit the real file: it would publish exactly what it exists to hide.
#
# Terms that are themselves sensitive: personal names, customer names, internal
# codenames. One extended-regex fragment per line; blank lines and '#' comments
# are ignored. Matched case-insensitively, on word boundaries.
#
# Placeholders only:
Alex
Jordan Example
ProjectBluebird
